     "en": "The next entrega covers 2015–2019: how a left-wing government carried out the program it had rejected, privatized the port of Piraeus by selling it to a Chinese state shipping line, signed the Prespa Agreement, and exited the programs in 2018 — and what happens to a party that does exactly the opposite of what it promised."
